00:13:45,814 --> 00:13:46,990
This is just stupid!

247
00:13:47,574 --> 00:13:49,103
We don't have much choice.

248
00:13:49,554 --> 00:13:51,071
We're a three-day walk from the town.

249
00:13:51,154 --> 00:13:53,994
No way! Not happening! All right, then.

250
00:13:54,474 --> 00:13:58,094
After your tantrum, we can set
up camp here for the night.

251
00:14:00,934 --> 00:14:03,110
There's nothing like a nice hot bath.

252
00:14:04,554 --> 00:14:06,834
Whoa, is that a full-course meal?

253
00:14:07,374 --> 00:14:09,374
Once the meat is done, it will be.

254
00:14:10,814 --> 00:14:13,285
How did you manage to find all this stuff?

255
00:14:13,414 --> 00:14:15,051
The village huntsmen helped.

256
00:14:15,134 --> 00:14:18,551
I asked some of them to teach me
what was forageable in the area.

257
00:14:18,634 --> 00:14:22,151
So you gathered all these ingredients
and cooked them while I was in the bath?

258
00:14:22,234 --> 00:14:23,314
We had a long day.

259
00:14:23,794 --> 00:14:25,371
Thus, I figured you'd be hungry.

260
00:14:25,454 --> 00:14:28,194
Except now I feel bad. Hang on.

261
00:14:28,434 --> 00:14:30,434
I know exactly what to contribute.

262
00:14:30,794 --> 00:14:32,394
It's party time now!

263
00:14:32,854 --> 00:14:34,171
Let's make the most of it!

264
00:14:34,254 --> 00:14:37,191
We can take these outside and
drink them under the stars!

265
00:14:37,274 --> 00:14:38,454
Cheers to us!

266
00:14:45,454 --> 00:14:47,094
Ah, man, that's good.

267
00:14:47,434 --> 00:14:48,552
Wipe your mustache.

268
00:14:49,054 --> 00:14:50,936
This looks absolutely delicious.

269
00:14:55,094 --> 00:14:56,474
Um, it's good.

270
00:14:56,674 --> 00:14:58,351
It's got a pretty distinct flavor.

271
00:14:58,434 --> 00:15:01,140
You know, in fact, it
reminds me of game meat.

272
00:15:02,894 --> 00:15:04,991
What was it you said this was again?

273
00:15:05,074 --> 00:15:05,904
I'm sorry.

274
00:15:05,994 --> 00:15:08,691
You fed me the Guardian deity, didn't you?

275
00:15:08,774 --> 00:15:12,091
I'd already drained its blood, and
I didn't want it to go to waste.

276
00:15:12,174 --> 00:15:13,703
That's not the issue here!

277
00:15:13,794 --> 00:15:16,071
I'm sorry I wasn't fully honest with you.

278
00:15:16,154 --> 00:15:19,978
I wanted to give you a warm meal
to help you recover your energy.

279
00:15:20,214 --> 00:15:22,951
And you needed the protein
to get back to full strength.

280
00:15:23,034 --> 00:15:25,563
He did all this because
I said I was tired.

281
00:15:27,154 --> 00:15:29,891
Well, all things aside, this
is actually pretty tasty.

282
00:15:29,974 --> 00:15:32,011
Plus, the beer is cold
and the air is crisp.

283
00:15:32,094 --> 00:15:33,294
No complaints here!

284
00:15:33,714 --> 00:15:35,274
Yes, it's a nice night.

285
00:15:36,074 --> 00:15:39,491
I can't wait to taste all the different
kinds of booze this world has.

286
00:15:39,574 --> 00:15:42,231
You're acting like we're
on vacation or something.

287
00:15:42,314 --> 00:15:44,531
And you're acting like
we're back at the office.

288
00:15:44,614 --> 00:15:46,611
It's been all work and no play with you.

289
00:15:46,694 --> 00:15:50,614
Now relax, or you'll stress
yourself bald. Bless you.

290
00:15:51,294 --> 00:15:52,834
We have earned a break.

291
00:15:52,994 --> 00:15:55,229
We've been so busy with work and life.

292
00:15:55,374 --> 00:15:57,331
When's the last time we took it easy?

293
00:15:57,414 --> 00:16:00,471
We're in a different world
with good food and free time.

294
00:16:00,554 --> 00:16:03,436
No one's watching, so why
not kick back for once?

295
00:16:03,694 --> 00:16:05,274
I hadn't thought of that.

296
00:16:07,894 --> 00:16:08,724
Very well.

297
00:16:08,914 --> 00:16:12,231
It has been quite a while since
I allowed myself to take a break.

298
00:16:12,314 --> 00:16:15,971
And you want to know what the best
part of being in a different world is?

299
00:16:16,054 --> 00:16:18,894
We do what we want.
Stop. What are you doing?

300
00:16:19,234 --> 00:16:22,651
Someone told me if I get too hot
I should take off my clothes.

301
00:16:22,734 --> 00:16:24,381
And I see that you're drunk.

302
00:16:24,534 --> 00:16:26,054
I can't be drunk.

303
00:16:26,314 --> 00:16:28,394
I just had a sip of beer.

304
00:16:28,614 --> 00:16:32,351
That is true, but of course you've
never imbibed with your new body.

305
00:16:32,434 --> 00:16:33,831
you've lost your tolerance.

306
00:16:33,914 --> 00:16:38,451
That explains why everything's suddenly
up and decided to start getting wobbly.

307
00:16:38,534 --> 00:16:41,454
It's the stupid tiny body
being stupid and tiny.

308
00:16:41,754 --> 00:16:42,634
Quit babbling.

309
00:16:42,954 --> 00:16:44,471
I think you've had enough tonight.

310
00:16:44,554 --> 00:16:46,614
You can finish it tomorrow. Okay?

311
00:16:47,494 --> 00:16:48,534
You idiot.

312
00:16:51,854 --> 00:16:54,972
You're forgetting our world's
rules don't apply here.

313
00:16:55,414 --> 00:16:57,834
So, I'll do what I want to!

314
00:16:58,134 --> 00:16:59,354
I have liberation!

315
00:16:59,814 --> 00:17:00,990
Don't run off naked!

316
00:17:04,114 --> 00:17:06,354
And still the same troublesome drunk.

317
00:17:06,674 --> 00:17:09,968
But wandering off semi-nude
is definitely a new feature.

318
00:17:10,074 --> 00:17:13,471
Could it be that it was more than
just the body that was changed?

319
00:17:13,554 --> 00:17:14,384
No.

320
00:17:14,467 --> 00:17:17,080
It's probably an effect
of some kind of skill.

321
00:17:19,314 --> 00:17:20,144
Okay...

322
00:17:20,227 --> 00:17:23,771
It seems this window pops up when I'm
thinking about the skills and their effects.

323
00:17:23,854 --> 00:17:26,851
But the effect of this so-called
blessing is utterly useless.

324
00:17:26,934 --> 00:17:28,094
Jenga J!

325
00:17:31,594 --> 00:17:32,714
No! Tachibana!

326
00:17:33,614 --> 00:17:34,673
Are you all right?

327
00:17:34,774 --> 00:17:35,604
What happened?

328
00:17:35,687 --> 00:17:39,274
I'm not sure how or why, but
I think I'm stuck. Wait there.

329
00:17:39,434 --> 00:17:40,493
I'll get you down.

330
00:17:41,494 --> 00:17:42,554
Could you hurry?

331
00:17:43,054 --> 00:17:45,371
All my blood is starting
to rust in my head

332
00:17:45,454 --> 00:17:48,134
and the springy rope
stuff is super annoying.

333
00:17:49,374 --> 00:17:50,914
No! Can't look!

334
00:17:51,214 --> 00:17:52,273
What's the matter?

335
00:17:52,474 --> 00:17:53,791
Why can't I see anything?

336
00:17:53,874 --> 00:17:56,934
You've been caught by some
strange sort of plant.

337
00:17:57,514 --> 00:17:59,094
Jinguuji, where are you?

338
00:17:59,594 --> 00:18:00,694
What's going on?

339
00:18:01,854 --> 00:18:02,894
This is bad.

340
00:18:03,094 --> 00:18:04,531
There's too much skin exposed.

341
00:18:04,614 --> 00:18:05,751
I don't want to look.

342
00:18:05,834 --> 00:18:07,010
Are you still there?

343
00:18:07,454 --> 00:18:08,431
Am I...

344
00:18:08,514 --> 00:18:10,094
both by myself?

345
00:18:10,494 --> 00:18:12,171
Would you please pull up your shirt?

346
00:18:12,254 --> 00:18:13,754
I'm here! Just hang on!

347
00:18:14,774 --> 00:18:16,715
These things are really annoying.

348
00:18:16,854 --> 00:18:18,434
Oh, here I can see now.

349
00:18:18,634 --> 00:18:20,105
Glad that crisis is over.

350
00:18:22,654 --> 00:18:24,183
I like it better this way.

351
00:18:24,274 --> 00:18:25,654
You are not helping!

352
00:18:26,034 --> 00:18:27,314
This is all too much!

353
00:18:27,514 --> 00:18:29,102
I'm seriously going to cry!

354
00:18:29,254 --> 00:18:31,511
Why does this have to
happen to little old me?

355
00:18:31,594 --> 00:18:33,123
You got drunk and ran off!

356
00:18:33,274 --> 00:18:35,134
This is 100 % your mess!

357
00:18:35,254 --> 00:18:37,351
Well then why didn't you try and stop me?

358
00:18:37,434 --> 00:18:38,554
I did, repeatedly!

359
00:18:39,514 --> 00:18:40,344
You're right.

360
00:18:40,427 --> 00:18:43,911
I was stupid and I'm sorry, now
please hurry up and save me!

361
00:18:43,994 --> 00:18:46,751
That's what I've been trying
to do, but something's wrong!

362
00:18:46,834 --> 00:18:48,451
I'm afraid I'm stuck like this!

363
00:18:48,534 --> 00:18:51,094
The thing's above your head again. Oh, no.

364
00:18:51,394 --> 00:18:52,923
Why is this happening now?

365
00:18:53,874 --> 00:18:58,031
Is it possible that I'm unable to
move because deep in my subconscious,

366
00:18:58,114 --> 00:19:01,014
I want to see Tachibana exposed like this?

367
00:19:01,994 --> 00:19:03,294
No, stay focused.

368
00:19:03,514 --> 00:19:04,951
That plant is already at the hair.

369
00:19:05,034 --> 00:19:07,231
I can't afford to be distracted right now.

370
00:19:07,314 --> 00:19:08,214
What can I do?

371
00:19:08,454 --> 00:19:10,311
As long as I'm charmed, I'm useless.

372
00:19:10,394 --> 00:19:11,276
Come on, think.

373
00:19:11,834 --> 00:19:14,069
Last time, that slap cured the effect.

374
00:19:14,174 --> 00:19:16,911
So it stands to reason another
severe shock could snap me out of it.

375
00:19:16,994 --> 00:19:17,824
That's it!

376
00:19:18,254 --> 00:19:19,084
Tachibana!

377
00:19:19,167 --> 00:19:22,051
I need you to say something that
will shock me to my very core!

378
00:19:22,134 --> 00:19:23,840
I'm not sure that's possible.

379
00:19:24,134 --> 00:19:27,331
My life is so boring, I couldn't
even make my grandmother blush.

380
00:19:27,414 --> 00:19:28,454
You have to try!

381
00:19:28,694 --> 00:19:30,223
And please, do it quickly!

382
00:19:30,414 --> 00:19:32,238
How about I take a nap instead?

383
00:19:32,734 --> 00:19:34,094
Just do it already!

384
00:19:35,534 --> 00:19:36,364
Peppers.

385
00:19:36,447 --> 00:19:37,514
I refuse to eat them.

386
00:19:42,514 --> 00:19:46,674
You're a 32-year-old man and you
still won't eat peppers? Really?

387
00:19:51,574 --> 00:19:54,851
I'm not quite sure where this rage
came from, but it did the trick.

388
00:19:54,934 --> 00:19:56,758
You doing all right over there?

389
00:20:01,474 --> 00:20:03,191
Congratulations, you leveled up.

390
00:20:03,274 --> 00:20:04,104
Screw you!

391
00:20:04,374 --> 00:20:06,411
Listen here, buddy, you can deflect beams,

392
00:20:06,494 --> 00:20:08,271
you're super strong
and you're still a guy!

393
00:20:08,354 --> 00:20:10,471
But I got turned into a
defenseless little girl?

394
00:20:10,554 --> 00:20:12,591
Who gets blind drunk off
one measly sip of beer!

395
00:20:12,674 --> 00:20:13,871
and bell pepper suck!

396
00:20:13,954 --> 00:20:16,719
I am not going to dignify
that with a response.

397
00:20:18,074 --> 00:20:21,250
Why do all the worst of the
worst things happen to me?

398
00:20:21,414 --> 00:20:25,811
I want to be reborn as a hot guy and
have loads of cute girls fun all over me!

399
00:20:25,894 --> 00:20:28,551
My whole life I've been teased
for having a girly name!

400
00:20:28,634 --> 00:20:31,451
Even my little sister
won't stop calling me Hina!

401
00:20:31,534 --> 00:20:33,891
Tsukasa-Chinkuchi is a
super cutesy name too!

402
00:20:33,974 --> 00:20:35,951
Why am I the only one getting picked on?

403
00:20:36,034 --> 00:20:36,864
Oh, I see.

404
00:20:37,274 --> 00:20:41,392
Now I understand why you gave the
heroine my name all those years ago.

405
00:20:43,154 --> 00:20:45,054
Please don't cry, Tachibana?

406
00:20:46,274 --> 00:20:49,691
It may sound selfish, but it
hurts me to see you this upset!

407
00:20:49,774 --> 00:20:51,714
Come on, let's go home.

408
00:21:05,974 --> 00:21:06,891
Hey, Jinguuji?

409
00:21:06,974 --> 00:21:08,094
Hm?

410
00:21:08,894 --> 00:21:13,934
Mother your spirit, between the two,
where do you think a person's gender lies?

411
00:21:18,594 --> 00:21:22,241
Honestly, I think that whichever
you think is right, is right.

412
00:21:24,514 --> 00:21:25,926
Is something the matter?

413
00:21:30,754 --> 00:21:34,271
I swear this rule is
totally crap! I'm done!

414
00:21:34,354 --> 00:21:37,734
You may look young, but you're
still a cranky old drunk.

415
00:21:41,274 --> 00:21:42,745
Where did this come from?

416
00:21:51,534 --> 00:21:53,874
This meat has a deliciously wild taste.

417
00:22:18,734 --> 00:22:20,494
Let's go!

418
